--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
‘RET’   ‘spofy-playlists-view’        View playlist tracks (*note detail view: Playlist detail view.)
‘p’     ‘spofy-playlists-play’        Play the playlist
‘c’     ‘spofy-create-playlist’       Create a new playlist
‘r’     ‘spofy-rename-playlist’       Rename the playlist at point
‘d’     ‘spofy-delete-playlist’       Delete (unfollow) the playlist
‘f’     ‘spofy-follow-playlist’       Follow a playlist by ID or URI
